  "fire": {
    "pulse": "primary fire (hold): play fire_start once (8 frames: the trigger pulls, the intake door opens 24 deg), then loop fire (30 frames = one EMP pulse: spawn it at Muzzle on the loop's frame 0, as the waveguide starts 1 cm back, 15 frames back, 15 home; the door flutters 3 deg), and on release play fire_end (14 frames: the door closes).",
    "air": "while the door is open (fire_start to fire_end) draw air into AirIntake (particles moving against its forward axis) and puff hot air out of the Vent gizmos on each pulse",
    "idle": "loop idle between shots: the intake door breathes 3 deg open and shut over 60 frames on its actuators. Every action starts and ends with the door where the next begins, so they chain without a jump.",
    "recoil_m": 0.01,
    "recoil_frames": [
      15,
      15
    ]
  },
